# Azure Defender — Lane B fixes for remediation

Subscription `a9049f9f` (Normain). Secure score 15.48% as of 2026-06-24. These are the **genuine + lower-urgency config fixes** from the Defender posture review — the real ISO-relevant hardening, separate from the 4,709 dependency-CVE findings (handled via the existing Trivy/Dependabot + nor-28xx bump flow) and from the items we're exempting.

**Priority:** High = real exposure, do first · Med = should do, lower urgency.
**Where:** mostly `terraform/modules/azure/` in the platform monorepo; AKS pod-security items are workload manifests/Helm enforced via the Azure Policy add-on.

| Pri | Defender recommendation | Affected | Resource | Concrete fix |
|---|---|---|---|---|
