| **High** | Storage accounts should prevent shared key access | 13 | `azurerm_storage_account` | `shared_access_key_enabled = false` (move callers to Entra/SAS first) |
| **High** | Secure transfer to storage should be enabled | 2 | `azurerm_storage_account` | `https_traffic_only_enabled = true` |
| **High** | Restrict storage network access (VNet rules + firewall) | 11+11 | `azurerm_storage_account` | `network_rules { default_action = "Deny"; virtual_network_subnet_ids = [...]; ip_rules = [...] }` |
| Med | Storage should use a private link connection | 13 | `azurerm_private_endpoint` | Private endpoint for blob/file subresource |
